# a quad and a pentagon sharing an edge, every corner in v/vt/vn form
mtllib space in name.mtl
o shapes
s off
v 0 0 0
v 1 0 0
v 1 1 0
v 0 1 0
v 2 0 0
v 2.5 0.5 0
v 2 1 0
vt 0 0
vt 1 0
vt 1 1
vt 0 1
vt 2 0
vt 2.5 0.5
vt 2 1
vn 0 0 1
g quad
usemtl painted
f 1/1/1 2/2/1 3/3/1 4/4/1 # a trailing comment is not a fifth corner
g pentagon
usemtl plain
f 2/2/1 5/5/1 6/6/1 7/7/1 3/3/1
